{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q7912549","formula":"C₄₄H₆₁N₉O₁₁","hill":"C44H61N9O11","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":44.0,"H":61.0,"N":9.0,"O":11.0},"names":{"en":"Valorphin"},"descriptions":{"en":"Valorphin, also known as VV-hemorphin-5, is a naturally occurring, endogenous opioid heptapeptide of the hemorphin family with the amino acid sequence H-Val-Val-Tyr-Pro-Trp-Thr-Gln-OH (VVYPWTQ). It is produced in the body via proteolyic cleavage of residues 33-39 of the β-chain of hemoglobin. Valorphin binds preferentially to the μ-opioid receptor and produces effects such as analgesia and self-administration in animals."},"fame":7,"pubchemCid":10485896,"mass":892.0,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H]([C@@H](C(=O)N[C@@H](CCC(=O)N)C(=O)O)NC(=O)[C@H](CC1=CNC2=CC=CC=C21)NC(=O)[C@@H]3CCCN3C(=O)[C@H](CC4=CC=C(C=C4)O)NC(=O)[C@H](C(C)C)NC(=O)[C@H](C(C)C)N)O","inchikey":"VAEOIFAHJWMTKD-NMUVPRMFSA-N","iupac":"(2S)-5-amino-2-[[(2S,3R)-2-[[(2S)-2-[[(2S)-1-[(2S)-2-[[(2S)-2-[[(2S)-2-amino-3-methylbutanoyl]amino]-3-methylbutanoyl]amino]-3-(4-hydroxyphenyl)propanoyl]pyrrolidine-2-carbonyl]amino]-3-(1H-indol-3-yl)propanoyl]amino]-3-hydroxybutanoyl]amino]-5-oxopentanoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"10485896","atoms":125,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-7.641,"y":3.066,"z":-4.416,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.369,"y":2.242,"z":-4.251,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.041,"y":1.965,"z":-2.763,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.87,"y":0.76,"z":-2.249,"el":"C"},{"x":-7.743,"y":0.205,"z":-2.915,"el":"O"},{"x":-6.627,"y":0.409,"z":-0.94,"el":"N"},{"x":-7.411,"y":-0.611,"z":-0.249,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.69,"y":-1.05,"z":1.033,"el":"C"},{"x":-7.226,"y":-2.356,"z":1.624,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.886,"y":-3.566,"z":0.779,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.993,"y":-3.598,"z":-0.06,"el":"O"},{"x":-7.624,"y":-4.677,"z":